    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 16 minutes, with his consent. He has never written a directive. He names a younger colleague and friend from his college as his health care agent and will complete the state form at his next visit. He would want full treatment for any illness he might recover from. He asked that his health information be shared only with his care team and his agent. [S]</paragraph></text>

